---
description: Testing and verification requirements
alwaysApply: true
---
- New behavior requires tests where practical.
- Run typecheck and lint after meaningful changes.
- Run relevant unit/integration tests.
- Run the production build before completing a phase.
- UI changes require browser verification.
- Crawler changes require SSRF/security regression tests.
- Directionality changes require LTR/RTL/mixed-direction tests.
- Dynamic changes require state-specific tests.
- Never report success based only on compilation.
